  "body": "Timeless design, exquisite craftsmanship and breathtaking views across the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\nOccupying an elevated, north-facing position along one of Takapuna's most coveted coastal addresses, this exceptional residence captures uninterrupted views across the Hauraki Gulf to Rangitoto Island. A private residents' walkway provides direct access to the shoreline, adding another dimension to an already remarkable lifestyle.\r\n\r\nOriginally built in 1980, the home has been comprehensively transformed into a residence of understated luxury, where European influences, beautiful natural materials and meticulous attention to detail come together effortlessly.\r\n\r\nAt its heart, an award-recognised designer kitchen makes an elegant statement. Leathered Alaska Quartzite, crown-cut oak cabinetry and premium integrated appliances combine to create a space as beautiful as it is functional, perfectly suited to both intimate gatherings and larger occasions.\r\n\r\nThree generous bedrooms are complemented by two beautifully appointed bathrooms, including a luxurious master ensuite, and a guest powder room. Every detail has been carefully considered, with an internal lift, full double glazing, ducted heating and cooling, underfloor heating and excellent storage ensuring comfort and convenience throughout.\r\n\r\nOutdoor living is equally impressive. Private entertaining spaces feature a built-in barbecue, wood-burning fireplace and spa, creating an inviting setting to enjoy throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nSecure double garaging and additional off-street parking complete the home, while the beaches, cafés, restaurants and boutique shopping of Milford and Takapuna are all just minutes away.\r\n\r\nEuropean sophistication, coastal tranquility and a lifestyle of effortless luxury.",
